        <mxCell id="cp_init" value='&lt;b&gt;src/initializer.js&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:11px"&gt;detects the package manager; installs @quality-sh/provenance as a dev dependency;&lt;br&gt;runs &amp;lt;engine&amp;gt; init --help to probe the flags; then &amp;lt;engine&amp;gt; init --path . --scope&lt;br&gt;default, with --invocation-channel typescript --package-manager &amp;lt;pm&amp;gt; when offered&lt;/font&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="cp">
